<section class="phero"><div class="phero-media"><img src="/assets/img/photos/calculator-papers.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calculator-papers-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calculator-papers.webp 960w" sizes="100vw" width="960" height="638" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" data-parallax="0.18"></div><div class="wrap phero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">/</span><a href="/calculators-for-policyholders/">Free tools</a><span class="sep" aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page">Claim Gap &amp; Fee Estimator</span></nav><p class="kicker">Free estimator</p><h1>Claim Gap &amp; Fee Estimator: An Insurance Appraisal Cost Calculator</h1><p class="lede">Enter the insurer’s number and yours, move the slider to test outcomes, and add fees. You’ll see whether appraisal is likely to leave you ahead once its costs are paid.</p></div></section><section class="sec sec-tool"><div class="wrap"><div class="rv">
<div class="tool" data-tool="gap">
  <div class="tool-head"><p class="tool-title">Claim gap &amp; fee estimator</p><i>Runs in your browser</i></div>
  <div class="tool-body">
    <div class="tool-in">
      <div class="row2">
        <div><label for="g-ins">Insurer’s estimate (RCV)</label><input id="g-ins" name="insurer" inputmode="decimal" value="21600"><span class="hint">Replacement cost total on the carrier’s estimate.</span></div>
        <div><label for="g-own">Your estimate (RCV)</label><input id="g-own" name="yours" inputmode="decimal" value="34900"><span class="hint">Your contractor’s or independent estimate.</span></div>
      </div>
      <div><label for="g-land">Where might the award land within the gap?</label>
        <div class="range"><input id="g-land" type="range" name="land" min="0" max="100" step="5" value="55" data-unit="%"><output>55%</output></div>
        <span class="hint">0% means the carrier’s number holds. 100% means your full number is awarded.</span></div>
      <div class="row2">
        <div><label for="g-ft">Your appraiser’s fee type</label><select id="g-ft" name="feetype"><option value="flat">Flat fee ($)</option><option value="pct">Percent of increase (%)</option></select></div>
        <div><label for="g-fee">Fee amount</label><input id="g-fee" name="fee" inputmode="decimal" value="2800"></div>
      </div>
      <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="useump" checked> Include half of an umpire’s fee</label>
      <div><label for="g-ump">Umpire’s total fee (split 50/50)</label><input id="g-ump" name="umpire" inputmode="decimal" value="3200"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="tool-out" aria-live="polite">
      <div class="out-big"><small>Estimated net increase to you</small><b data-o="net">$0</b></div>
      <div class="stack" aria-hidden="true"><span class="s1"></span><span class="s2"></span><span class="s3"></span></div>
      <div class="legend"><span><i class="s1"></i>Carrier’s number</span><span><i class="s2"></i>Your net gain</span><span><i class="s3"></i>Appraisal costs</span></div>
      <div class="out-rows">
        <div><span>Amount in dispute</span><b data-o="gap">$0</b></div>
        <div><span>Gap as % of carrier estimate</span><b data-o="pct">—</b></div>
        <div><span>Projected award (RCV)</span><b data-o="award">$0</b></div>
        <div><span>Gross increase</span><b data-o="gain">$0</b></div>
        <div><span>Your appraisal costs</span><b data-o="cost">$0</b></div>
      </div>
      <p class="out-msg" data-o="msg"></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></div><p class="tool-note">For planning only. Results depend on the figures you enter and your policy’s terms. They aren’t a quote, an appraisal or legal advice. Default figures are illustrative.</p><noscript><p class="tool-note">This calculator needs JavaScript. Everything runs in your browser and nothing is sent anywhere.</p></noscript></div></section><div class="wrap two-col"><article class="prose">
<h2>Using the insurance appraisal cost calculator</h2>
<ol><li><strong>Enter the insurer’s replacement cost total</strong>, before depreciation and deductible.</li>
<li><strong>Enter your estimate</strong>, also at replacement cost, from a contractor or independent estimator.</li>
<li><strong>Test several outcomes.</strong> Try 30%, 55% and 80% on the slider instead of trusting one answer.</li>
<li><strong>Add fees</strong> using your appraiser’s quoted arrangement and a realistic umpire fee.</li></ol>
<h2>Reading the result</h2>
<p>If your net only turns positive near 100%, the case depends on winning every item, and that’s fragile. If it stays positive at 40% or 50%, the dispute is large enough that appraisal may be worth discussing. Example figures in the tool are illustrative.</p>
<h2>What it leaves out</h2>
<p>Deductibles, depreciation timing and policy limits change what you’re paid, not the size of the dispute. For those, use the <a href="/calculators-for-policyholders/holdback-recovery-calculator/">holdback recovery calculator</a> and the <a href="/calculators-for-policyholders/hurricane-wind-deductible-converter/">deductible converter</a>.</p>
<h2>Questions about this tool</h2><div class="faq"><details><summary>Is the projected award a prediction?</summary><div class="faq-a"><p>No. It’s a scenario you choose. Real awards depend on documentation, the panel and your policy.</p></div></details><details><summary>What do appraisers typically charge?</summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Arrangements vary: flat fees, hourly rates or a percentage of the increase. Get the fee in writing before you sign, and compare it with the gap you’re trying to close.</p></div></details></div><h2>More free tools</h2><div class="related"><a href="/calculators-for-policyholders/holdback-recovery-calculator/"><small>Calculator</small><span>Holdback Recovery Calculator</span></a><a href="/calculators-for-policyholders/roof-pitch-and-squares-checker/"><small>Calculator</small><span>Roof Pitch &amp; Squares Checker</span></a><a href="/calculators-for-policyholders/hurricane-wind-deductible-converter/"><small>Converter</small><span>Hurricane &amp; Wind Deductible Converter</span></a></div></article><aside class="aside"><div class="aside-in"><div class="box box-call"><h2 class="box-h">Talk it through first</h2><p>The first conversation is free. We’ll tell you plainly whether appraisal fits your claim.</p><a class="box-tel" href="tel:+18445371427">+1 (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-accent btn-block" href="/schedule-a-claim-review/">Send claim details</a><p class="box-small">Mon–Fri 8am–6pm ET · All of Virginia</p></div><div class="box"><h2 class="box-h">All free tools</h2><ul class="box-list"><li><a href="/calculators-for-policyholders/claim-gap-and-fee-estimator/" aria-current="page">Claim Gap &amp; Fee Estimator</a></li><li><a href="/calculators-for-policyholders/holdback-recovery-calculator/">Holdback Recovery Calculator</a></li><li><a href="/calculators-for-policyholders/roof-pitch-and-squares-checker/">Roof Pitch &amp; Squares Checker</a></li><li><a href="/calculators-for-policyholders/hurricane-wind-deductible-converter/">Hurricane &amp; Wind Deductible Converter</a></li><li><a href="/calculators-for-policyholders/claim-clock-calendar-builder/">Claim Clock &amp; Calendar Builder</a></li><li><a href="/calculators-for-policyholders/appraisal-readiness-scorecard/">Appraisal Readiness Scorecard</a></li><li><a href="/calculators-for-policyholders/fallen-tree-claim-splitter/">Fallen Tree Claim Splitter</a></li></ul></div></div></aside></div><section class="cta-strip"><div class="wrap cta-strip-in rv"><div><h2>Want a professional to check the numbers?</h2><p>Send us your estimate and we’ll review it line by line.</p></div><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-accent" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="i" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-ghost-light" href="/schedule-a-claim-review/">Email the estimate</a></div></div></section>
